â€¢
[grasp] â†’ [tool use] â†’ [gesture] â†’ [language precursor]
â€¢
This chain demonstrates how a physical substrate (hand) is reappropriated through tool use, leading to symbolic representations (gesture, language precursor), which constitutes knowledge creation. The risk mentioned is the ossification of symbols (e.g., dogmatic rituals).
Potential Areas for Further Investigation:
