lass="ProseMirror-trailingBreak"></p><p><span><strong>Polyconstructor</strong></span><span>: An extension of Deutsch's constructorâ€”an entity whose functional class evolves through recursive application of R, enabling it to reappropriate substrates into new symbolic domains.</span></p><p><span><strong>Embodied Symbol Emergence</strong></span><span>: A symbol is considered embodied if it results from at least two reappropriation layers:
